D>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":538,"row":{"en":"When a seed sprouts, it is a sign of hope and new beginnings.","wo":"Jiwwu wu sax dafay jur yaakaar ak ndoorte lu bees.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjiiwu wou sakh dafay diour yakar ak ndorté lou bess.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":539,"row":{"en":"Who are you? I asked. I am the Angel of Death, she said.","wo":"Mani ko, Yaw la kan? Mani ma, Man la Malaakal Mawti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMani ko yaw la kan? Mani ma mane la malaakal mawti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":540,"row":{"en":"The PC's portability and versatility made it an ideal tool for a wide range of tasks, from word processing to gaming.","wo":"Neexa yorug PC ak limu mëna def lu bari moo tax mu nekk jumtukaay bi gëna baax ci liggéey, dalee ko ci bind ak jeu video.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNekhna yorougue PC ak limou meuna def lou bari mo takh mou nek djumtoukay bi gueuna bakh thi liguey dalé ko thi bind ak jeu vidéo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":541,"row":{"en":"We're not sure what's causing it to lean so precariously! said a little sparrow.","wo":"Benn moinóo daal di Xamu nu lu waral mu wéng bay waaja daanu!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn moineau daldi khamou niou lou waral mou weng bay wadia danou!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":542,"row":{"en":"YouTube also gives brands the possibility to customize how their channel looks.","wo":"YouTube itam dafay may màrk yi ñu mëna tànn seeni melokaani chaine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYoutube itam dafay may mark yi niou meuna tane seeni melokaani chaine bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":543,"row":{"en":"They can owe the tenant twice the security deposit plus court fees.","wo":"Mën nañu yoreel kiy luwe ñaari yoon seen kosioŋ boole ci fere dosiye yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou yoréle ki loué gnaari yone seen caution bolé si fer